1) Unpack:
$ tar -zxvf caffa-sst

2) Enter folder with source code

$ cd caffa-sst-v1.0
$ cd komega-menter-sst

3) Modify 'param.inc' file according to mesh you have created
NOTE: By this stage you should have created the mesh with the program provided 
in grid2d folder. 

4) Compile:
$ chmod +x make-caffa-sst
$ make-caffa-sst
$ ./caffa-sst
